### Task Management API — nümunə request-lər
### IntelliJ HTTP Client / VS Code "REST Client" ilə işləyir.
### (Dərs 4-dən sonra server localhost:8080-də qalxacaq.)

@base = http://localhost:8080

### 1. User yarat
POST {{base}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Darya",
  "email": "darya@example.com"
}

### 2. User-i al
GET {{base}}/users/1

### 3. Task yarat
POST {{base}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Backend syllabus hazırla",
  "description": "8 dərslik plan",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "userId": 1
}

### 4. Bütün task-lar
GET {{base}}/tasks

### 5. Status filtri ilə
GET {{base}}/tasks?status=TODO

### 6. Task-ı al
GET {{base}}/tasks/1

### 7. Task-ı yenilə (PATCH)
PATCH {{base}}/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS"
}

### 8. User-in task-ları
GET {{base}}/users/1/tasks

### 9. Task-ı sil
DELETE {{base}}/tasks/1

### 10. Category yarat
POST {{base}}/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Seyidxanim"
}

### 11. Category-i al
GET {{base}}/categories/1

### 12. Bütün category-ler
GET {{base}}/categories

### 13. Category-i sil
DELETE {{base}}/categories/1